WEBVTT

00:31.040 --> 00:33.290
[You Have My Heart]

00:33.370 --> 00:36.210
[Episode 3: The Life-and-Death Wager]

00:50.050 --> 00:51.700
The spiritual power is not enough.

00:51.700 --> 00:53.700
Now that the tree heart's right before us.

00:53.700 --> 00:56.030
Master, you may take it whenever you want.

01:02.160 --> 01:03.290
Why does Lady Fufeng

01:03.930 --> 01:05.820
keep following us?

01:10.490 --> 01:12.100
There were bran and grease

01:12.700 --> 01:14.760
in the wine merchant's fingernails.

01:15.010 --> 01:17.380
There was grease on Widow Liu's neck too.

01:18.410 --> 01:20.210
It came from a sesame flatbread.

01:52.130 --> 01:53.190
Thank you, My Lady.

01:56.940 --> 01:57.400
My Lady,

01:57.940 --> 01:58.860
did you happen to find

01:58.860 --> 02:01.190
a discarded flatbread at the crime scene?

02:02.200 --> 02:04.130
I wasn't paying attention to that.

02:04.130 --> 02:06.540
Xiqianhua only collects corpses
and suppresses evil spirits.

02:06.540 --> 02:08.380
We don't pick up trash from the roadside.

02:08.380 --> 02:10.180
What about the autopsy records?

02:10.460 --> 02:12.320
There was no mention of it either.

02:13.850 --> 02:15.980
How was this crucial clue overlooked?

02:22.130 --> 02:23.660
May Lady Fufeng protect us.

02:23.680 --> 02:25.210
May Lady Fufeng protect us.

02:28.720 --> 02:30.030
What's written on this?

02:29.520 --> 02:32.670
[Huge bounty for clues on the echo demon]

02:30.170 --> 02:31.370
It's a reward notice.

02:35.060 --> 02:35.570
My Lord,

02:35.670 --> 02:38.370
is there really a silver reward
for providing clues?

02:38.370 --> 02:40.100
Of course. Please, have a seat.

02:40.680 --> 02:41.940
Here's thing, My Lord.

02:42.010 --> 02:43.290
That day, I went to Nanqiutou Road

02:43.290 --> 02:44.980
to buy sesame flatbread from that shop.

02:44.980 --> 02:45.890
And I saw a figure there,

02:45.890 --> 02:46.850
sneaking around

02:47.380 --> 02:48.840
and acting suspiciously.

02:49.220 --> 02:50.540
Does that count as a clue?

02:50.540 --> 02:51.010
It does.

02:53.350 --> 02:54.410
Thank you, My Lord.

02:56.790 --> 02:57.610
Ma'am!

02:58.980 --> 03:00.310
Mind your own business.

03:01.650 --> 03:03.860
His annual salary is only 30 taels,

03:04.380 --> 03:05.970
and he even lent 5 taels to us.

03:05.970 --> 03:08.610
His Lordship has truly emptied
his pockets this time.

03:08.610 --> 03:09.940
Who knows if it'll help?

03:11.010 --> 03:13.010
Where there is a will, there is a way.

03:20.790 --> 03:22.260
According to a beggar boy named Rat,

03:22.260 --> 03:23.980
he learned a nursery rhyme
from a child in red.

03:23.980 --> 03:28.290
Old things return,
shifting within the heart.

03:28.290 --> 03:32.850
Not their rightful owner—
calamity will not cease.

03:33.470 --> 03:36.930
He was given a sesame flatbread
in exchange for memorizing it.

03:42.130 --> 03:44.460
A sesame flatbread and a nursery rhyme...

03:45.270 --> 03:46.800
Hu, Deputy Magistrate Shi.

03:48.820 --> 03:50.540
Find that beggar boy Rat immediately,

03:50.540 --> 03:52.800
along with the child in red
he mentioned.

03:54.240 --> 03:55.810
-How are we supposed to find them?
-This...

03:55.810 --> 03:58.210
Send more men
to search the mountain at once.

03:58.210 --> 03:59.650
And we need to find
Village Chief Zhou as soon as possible.

03:59.650 --> 04:01.380
Dead or alive, we must find him.

04:01.700 --> 04:02.900
Search the mountain?

04:02.970 --> 04:03.420
Right.

04:04.640 --> 04:05.090
You...

04:07.220 --> 04:08.860
But we don't have enough men.

04:10.570 --> 04:11.900
I only have one day left.

04:15.420 --> 04:15.880
Master.

04:16.540 --> 04:17.740
He noticed that lead.

04:19.060 --> 04:21.260
A sesame flatbread and a nursery rhyme.

04:21.620 --> 04:22.450
From such seemingly trivial details,

04:22.450 --> 04:24.300
he managed to trace

04:25.080 --> 04:26.610
the source of all calamity.

04:29.010 --> 04:30.420
But in this wager,

04:31.510 --> 04:33.040
he has no chance of winning.

04:45.650 --> 04:46.710
The villagers said

04:47.090 --> 04:48.300
that on the day of the incident,

04:48.300 --> 04:49.340
they saw Village Chief Zhou

04:49.340 --> 04:51.420
running into the mountains in a panic.

04:51.420 --> 04:53.280
Perhaps he really is hiding here.

04:53.570 --> 04:55.640
But the mountain is huge,
and it's raining now.

04:55.640 --> 04:58.500
I'm afraid we'll freeze to death
before we find him.

04:59.970 --> 05:00.630
Over there.

05:05.740 --> 05:06.340
Sir,

05:06.930 --> 05:09.460
have you seen
Village Chief Zhou Ming nearby?

05:12.360 --> 05:15.220
What are you doing
in the mountains so late at night?

05:22.370 --> 05:23.770
Village Chief Zhou Ming!

05:24.840 --> 05:25.480
Zhou Ming?

05:58.210 --> 06:00.540
Hold the candle. Prepare for the autopsy.

06:03.900 --> 06:04.760
Another death?

06:05.010 --> 06:06.300
Hurry up. Hurry up.

06:23.010 --> 06:25.410
Deputy Magistrate Shi, what are you doing?

06:26.570 --> 06:28.170
This was an unnatural death!

06:28.500 --> 06:30.680
We must inform Lady Fufeng immediately.

06:30.680 --> 06:32.680
It's the rule of Yin-Yang Crossing.

06:33.530 --> 06:34.730
If you beat this drum,

06:35.130 --> 06:36.570
will Liu Fufeng hear it?

06:38.320 --> 06:39.380
Young Magistrate,

06:39.830 --> 06:41.440
this Liu Drum is connected

06:41.550 --> 06:43.540
to the earth veins of Yin-Yang Crossing.

06:43.540 --> 06:45.400
Of course Lady Fufeng can hear it.

06:45.770 --> 06:47.180
Three beats mean emergency;
five mean death.

06:47.180 --> 06:48.380
Beating it five times

06:48.420 --> 06:49.820
means it's a murder case.

06:52.620 --> 06:53.280
Five beats.

06:54.210 --> 06:55.010
A murder case.

06:56.510 --> 06:59.120
The three-day agreement is due.

07:42.530 --> 07:43.750
According to the examination of the scene,

07:43.750 --> 07:46.180
there were no signs
of a struggle near the body.

07:46.180 --> 07:49.620
The terrain around the scene
was flat and open,

07:49.860 --> 07:52.390
and none of Zhou Ming's
valuables were taken.

07:52.570 --> 07:53.450
Based on this,

07:53.700 --> 07:55.740
it is concluded that while fleeing,

07:55.760 --> 07:56.620
he was startled

07:56.700 --> 07:58.560
and died of sudden heart failure.

07:59.060 --> 08:00.210
There's another possibility.

08:00.210 --> 08:02.300
He committed suicide
out of fear of punishment.

08:02.300 --> 08:04.300
Lord Bai solves cases
with remarkable efficiency.

08:04.300 --> 08:05.450
Are you suggesting

08:05.730 --> 08:07.780
that after murdering Widow Liu,

08:07.780 --> 08:09.110
the killer fled in fear,

08:09.210 --> 08:10.230
lost his way in the mountains,

08:10.230 --> 08:11.830
and was frightened to death?

08:11.840 --> 08:12.570
Not exactly.

08:13.250 --> 08:14.620
In the wine merchant's sudden death case,

08:14.620 --> 08:17.450
both victims ate sesame flatbread
before they died.

08:17.450 --> 08:18.650
And Zhou Ming had also

08:18.700 --> 08:21.030
eaten sesame flatbread before his death.

08:21.250 --> 08:23.100
Isn't that just common travel food?

08:23.100 --> 08:24.630
What's so unusual about it?

08:24.850 --> 08:27.180
You seem so obsessed with this flatbread.

08:27.540 --> 08:30.200
Were you a starving ghost
in your previous life?

08:42.530 --> 08:43.490
This piece of paper

08:43.490 --> 08:44.690
is even less unusual.

08:45.460 --> 08:48.790
Because it's nothing more than
oiled paper used to wrap flatbread.

08:48.790 --> 08:49.970
The most important thing right now

08:49.970 --> 08:52.700
is to find the shop owner
that sold the flatbread.

08:53.730 --> 08:55.460
Then the case is already clear.

08:56.460 --> 08:58.630
You've identified Zhou Ming as the killer,

08:58.630 --> 09:00.100
and now the killer is dead.

09:01.140 --> 09:03.480
Based on your six months
of experience as an official,

09:03.480 --> 09:05.690
do you consider this case closed?

09:09.300 --> 09:09.780
No.

09:12.610 --> 09:13.870
Another clue suggests

09:14.610 --> 09:15.490
that a beggar

09:15.970 --> 09:17.210
learned a nursery rhyme

09:17.210 --> 09:19.810
from a child in red
in exchange for a flatbread.

09:20.490 --> 09:21.420
But so far,

09:21.970 --> 09:23.970
that child in red has not been found.

09:24.540 --> 09:26.490
This case is full of unanswered questions.

09:26.490 --> 09:27.620
It cannot be closed.

09:30.540 --> 09:31.270
Lady Fufeng,

09:32.180 --> 09:34.180
I lost our wager.

09:36.700 --> 09:38.300
You are indeed a man of honor.

09:42.210 --> 09:44.610
Knowing a task cannot be accomplished,

09:45.370 --> 09:48.140
yet admitting defeat openly.

09:50.300 --> 09:51.560
In that case, Lord Bai,

09:52.370 --> 09:54.300
will you fulfill the bet right now?

09:57.470 --> 10:00.470
I was only fulfilling my duty.

10:04.850 --> 10:05.510
Never mind.

10:07.210 --> 10:08.420
The three days are up,

10:09.090 --> 10:10.210
and the case remains unsolved.

10:10.210 --> 10:11.270
I will keep my word.

10:11.370 --> 10:12.700
My life is yours to take.

10:44.580 --> 10:45.840
I've finally found it!

10:46.610 --> 10:48.180
The perfect vessel.

10:51.850 --> 10:52.700
And now...

10:53.880 --> 10:55.120
you're mine.

11:14.850 --> 11:16.180
What have you done to me?

11:17.610 --> 11:20.780
Didn't you want to gouge out my heart?

11:22.660 --> 11:24.790
You'd rather die than break your word,

11:25.390 --> 11:26.920
and rather break than bend.

11:28.140 --> 11:29.270
I've actually begun

11:29.610 --> 11:31.300
to admire you a little.

11:35.850 --> 11:37.780
I consider you've passed the test.

11:38.180 --> 11:40.840
I'll allow you to stay
and serve as a magistrate.

11:45.210 --> 11:46.010
The other day,

11:46.820 --> 11:48.680
you said you'd gouge out my heart.

11:48.900 --> 11:51.420
Now you're talking about admiration.

11:52.020 --> 11:53.180
Being so fickle,

11:53.930 --> 11:55.570
you really are like a demon.

12:03.610 --> 12:05.340
About the three-day agreement,

12:05.340 --> 12:06.820
do you know why you lost?

12:10.690 --> 12:12.290
Not because you are foolish,

12:13.060 --> 12:14.090
but because

12:15.350 --> 12:17.150
you have no one at your disposal.

12:20.060 --> 12:21.590
Aren't you looking for him?

12:30.570 --> 12:31.730
The child in red.

12:33.650 --> 12:35.650
With Xiqianhua's support,

12:36.700 --> 12:39.360
you'll have both the authority
and the manpower

12:39.940 --> 12:42.140
to find the real source of all calamity.

12:42.390 --> 12:43.850
So my life is yours to take,

12:44.300 --> 12:46.100
and yours to spare as you please?

12:47.730 --> 12:48.480
Lord Bai,

12:49.140 --> 12:50.340
before you came here,

12:50.750 --> 12:52.810
you must have prepared for the worst.

12:53.940 --> 12:55.850
Now, not only am I sparing your life,

12:55.850 --> 12:57.060
but I'm also reopening the county yamen

12:57.060 --> 12:58.720
and helping you investigate.

12:59.610 --> 13:00.410
By that logic,

13:01.850 --> 13:04.510
it seems you're the one
getting the better deal.

13:06.060 --> 13:09.610
Whatever Lady Fufeng says, goes.

13:10.450 --> 13:11.780
I just don't understand

13:12.540 --> 13:13.940
what it is you truly want.

13:15.620 --> 13:16.430
What I want

13:17.780 --> 13:20.040
is the stability for Yin-Yang Crossing.

13:21.730 --> 13:22.420
Of course,

13:23.250 --> 13:24.850
once this matter is settled,

13:25.090 --> 13:27.350
I'll write that recommendation letter.

13:35.970 --> 13:36.540
Master.

13:37.020 --> 13:38.620
We've tried so many methods.

13:38.660 --> 13:40.790
Why can't we retrieve that half heart?

13:41.970 --> 13:43.520
Because he is not Bai Han.

13:45.140 --> 13:46.800
How can you be so sure, Master?

15:16.850 --> 15:17.820
Lady Fufeng,

15:18.500 --> 15:20.700
the evil power has finally been sealed.

15:32.350 --> 15:33.110
Bai Han,

15:35.550 --> 15:36.950
defeating the evil power

15:37.160 --> 15:38.560
was my own desire.

15:39.970 --> 15:42.030
I never did it to earn your gratitude.

15:43.380 --> 15:43.990
Fufeng,

15:44.980 --> 15:46.240
you need to let this go.

15:49.060 --> 15:49.770
No.

15:51.060 --> 15:52.770
This surge of evil power

15:53.370 --> 15:55.250
threw Yin-Yang Crossing into chaos

15:55.250 --> 15:56.780
and implicated you as well.

15:57.140 --> 15:57.970
I'm sorry.

15:59.140 --> 15:59.850
From now on,

16:00.620 --> 16:02.420
you'll have to rely on yourself.

16:15.440 --> 16:16.200
Fufeng.

16:19.030 --> 16:19.820
You...

16:21.040 --> 16:21.520
You...

16:27.490 --> 16:28.620
This half of my heart

16:29.370 --> 16:31.100
contains half my cultivation.

16:32.490 --> 16:35.010
Today, I give it to you.

16:35.910 --> 16:36.550
Don't!

16:42.490 --> 16:43.210
Fufeng.

16:44.180 --> 16:45.860
I'm giving you my heart today,

16:47.590 --> 16:49.920
not only to restore your spiritual power,

16:50.970 --> 16:52.230
but also because I hope

16:53.180 --> 16:54.660
you'll stand beside me

16:55.180 --> 16:57.210
to guard Yin-Yang Crossing,

16:58.560 --> 16:59.960
suppress the evil power,

17:00.180 --> 17:02.110
and protect the spiritual energy.

17:03.940 --> 17:04.940
I, Bai Han,

17:05.940 --> 17:07.180
hereby swear

17:07.859 --> 17:09.420
that in this life,

17:09.859 --> 17:11.060
I will never fail you.

17:15.750 --> 17:16.859
It's a promise.

17:21.980 --> 17:23.579
A hundred years have passed.

17:23.579 --> 17:26.900
Bai Han likely cannot withstand
the tree heart's spiritual power.

17:26.900 --> 17:27.660
I don't know

17:27.660 --> 17:29.380
what wicked method he used,

17:30.180 --> 17:30.970
but it seems

17:31.580 --> 17:34.620
he used Bai Shanjun
as a vessel to nourish the heart.

17:35.860 --> 17:37.770
We need to find another way
to take the heart.

17:37.770 --> 17:39.900
For now, I'll keep him here and observe

17:40.430 --> 17:43.630
to see what Bai Han is really up to.

17:43.840 --> 17:45.930
[Yin-Yang Crossing Magistrate's Office]

17:44.860 --> 17:45.600
Be careful.

17:45.620 --> 17:46.550
Watch your step.

17:48.490 --> 17:49.490
Don't go this way.

17:50.730 --> 17:52.530
There are still more over there.

17:52.730 --> 17:53.730
Don't break them.

17:58.490 --> 17:59.290
It's so heavy.

18:00.620 --> 18:01.420
What is this?

18:01.860 --> 18:02.490
Slow down.

18:05.660 --> 18:06.250
Let's go.

18:07.740 --> 18:08.310
Careful.

18:09.010 --> 18:09.730
This way.

18:09.730 --> 18:10.250
Careful.

18:10.250 --> 18:10.860
Put it here.

18:10.520 --> 18:14.690
[Perspicacious and impartial in judgment]

18:18.320 --> 18:19.000
My Lord.

18:19.610 --> 18:20.410
My Lord.

18:22.570 --> 18:23.700
Take a look around.

18:24.830 --> 18:26.560
Lady Fufeng is so thoughtful.

18:26.680 --> 18:29.140
She specially allocated funds and manpower

18:29.270 --> 18:32.000
to renovate the county yamen.

18:33.050 --> 18:34.970
She even said Shuan is smart,

18:35.800 --> 18:38.360
so he can stay here as an errand boy.

18:39.310 --> 18:40.440
Greetings, My Lord.

18:41.420 --> 18:43.420
Easy there. Don't break it.

18:43.790 --> 18:44.590
Put it here.

18:46.440 --> 18:47.290
Lad, you are

18:47.430 --> 18:48.490
quite a character.

18:48.760 --> 18:53.360
Impressive enough to convince me to come
down the mountains and be your constable.

18:53.770 --> 18:56.370
Then let's get to the bottom
of this case first.

18:56.860 --> 18:58.010
I hope all my esteemed colleagues

18:58.010 --> 19:00.180
will work with me
to keep Yin-Yang Crossing stable

19:00.180 --> 19:02.310
and share Lady Fufeng's burden.

19:06.570 --> 19:07.900
Deputy Magistrate Shi,

19:07.910 --> 19:10.080
search the entire city for this child.

19:14.070 --> 19:15.390
We've found this boy

19:15.420 --> 19:16.480
just this morning.

19:17.450 --> 19:18.490
Bring him in.

19:24.670 --> 19:25.670
My Lord.

19:27.920 --> 19:31.160
My son went out to buy candy two days ago,

19:31.700 --> 19:34.540
and came back completely unresponsive.

19:34.980 --> 19:36.110
Please get up first.

19:41.750 --> 19:43.080
Has he seen a physician?

19:43.380 --> 19:44.140
Yes.

19:44.310 --> 19:46.910
The physician said
it was caused by corruption

19:47.030 --> 19:49.230
and told us to seek help from Xiqianhua.

19:49.290 --> 19:51.290
I've already hung a wishing plaque.

19:51.450 --> 19:55.730
I wonder if Lady Fufeng will help him.

19:57.990 --> 19:58.780
Candy?

19:59.640 --> 20:01.640
Wasn't he buying sesame flatbread?

20:02.010 --> 20:03.070
Sesame flatbread?

20:04.380 --> 20:05.420
I don't know.

20:06.210 --> 20:08.660
I only asked him to buy candy.

20:08.770 --> 20:12.420
Whispers echo in the forest,
each cry like weeping.

20:12.420 --> 20:18.220
-Mimicking human speech, it drains away vitality.
-Whispers echo in the forest, each cry like weeping.

20:18.380 --> 20:23.110
Mimicking human speech,
it drains away vitality.

20:23.140 --> 20:23.910
The smell is strong.

20:23.910 --> 20:28.910
Old things return,
shifting within the heart.

20:29.700 --> 20:33.460
Not their rightful owner—
calamity will not cease.

20:33.490 --> 20:35.060
Why does it smell so strange?

20:35.060 --> 20:36.890
Whispers echo in the forest...

20:37.900 --> 20:40.380
It seems Lord Bai has found a new job:

20:40.690 --> 20:42.890
practicing medicine and saving lives.

20:44.420 --> 20:46.420
Why don't you save him, Lady Fufeng?

20:48.860 --> 20:49.710
I can't.

20:53.050 --> 20:55.940
This is a poison originates
from the Yin-Yang Crossing.

20:55.940 --> 20:57.450
As long as we find the source of it,

20:57.450 --> 20:59.310
it can be cured with the proper medicine.

20:59.310 --> 21:02.310
Lord Bai, you've read
countless medical books.

21:02.380 --> 21:03.770
Have you ever seen a case

21:04.170 --> 21:06.700
matching these burns
left by the corruption?

21:08.660 --> 21:09.700
This corruption

21:09.720 --> 21:11.800
consumes the mind and destroys the body.

21:11.800 --> 21:13.760
Decoctions are useless.

21:15.540 --> 21:18.140
The fact that this child
still has a breath left

21:18.530 --> 21:20.530
is already a mercy from the heavens.

21:21.370 --> 21:24.050
Not their rightful owner—

21:24.380 --> 21:26.860
calamity will not cease.

21:29.730 --> 21:30.560
My Lady.

21:32.410 --> 21:35.070
Does the corruption
really exist in this world?

21:38.420 --> 21:39.530
You and I are

21:39.700 --> 21:41.620
practically in the same boat now.

21:42.140 --> 21:45.740
There's no need to manipulate me
with stories of ghosts and gods.

21:47.180 --> 21:49.050
Whether I'm manipulating you or not,

21:49.050 --> 21:50.650
you'll find out soon enough.

21:51.600 --> 21:53.670
Fengling, go get today's case files.

21:54.090 --> 21:55.580
Yes, Master.

21:59.290 --> 22:00.890
Make sure they're archived.

22:07.260 --> 22:08.020
Your hand.

22:11.010 --> 22:11.650
What for?

22:15.270 --> 22:17.250
To see how much longer a stubborn fool

22:17.250 --> 22:18.650
like you has left to live.

22:19.600 --> 22:21.600
I don't want you dying in front of me.

22:21.730 --> 22:22.540
It's bad luck.

22:24.580 --> 22:28.060
I didn't know
Lady Fufeng could read palms.

22:43.730 --> 22:45.620
I suggest you be careful

22:45.960 --> 22:47.760
while investigating, Lord Bai.

22:47.900 --> 22:49.900
Don't let that evil power taint you,

22:49.900 --> 22:51.100
corrupt your mind,

22:51.660 --> 22:53.120
and make you just like him.

22:55.150 --> 22:57.900
If that happens,
I really won't be able to save you.

22:57.900 --> 22:58.530
I mean...

22:59.420 --> 23:00.680
Take care of yourself.

23:11.140 --> 23:12.740
Whispers echo in the forest,

23:12.810 --> 23:14.070
each cry like weeping.

23:14.730 --> 23:16.130
Mimicking human speech,

23:16.160 --> 23:17.560
it drains away vitality.

23:18.030 --> 23:20.490
This is the tune
of the legendary echo demon.

23:21.400 --> 23:22.800
But the last few lines...

23:23.490 --> 23:26.090
Old things return,
shifting within the heart.

23:26.100 --> 23:28.960
Not their rightful owner—
calamity will not cease.

23:29.350 --> 23:32.920
Old things, heart, not its rightful owner.

23:33.730 --> 23:35.930
It sounds like the heart you mentioned.

23:36.580 --> 23:37.580
That magistrate...

23:37.580 --> 23:39.110
Isn't the heart in his chest

23:39.790 --> 23:41.920
the other half of your tree heart?

23:43.180 --> 23:45.220
But this nursery rhyme

23:45.250 --> 23:47.110
started spreading two weeks ago.

23:47.450 --> 23:49.730
Bai Shanjun hadn't arrived at that time.

23:49.860 --> 23:52.810
What if we look at it from another angle?

23:55.390 --> 23:58.520
Not their rightful owner—
calamity will not cease.

23:59.650 --> 24:01.050
Perhaps it means

24:01.660 --> 24:03.390
the half of the heart that I hold

24:03.770 --> 24:05.370
doesn't belong to me either.

24:05.620 --> 24:08.620
Could all of this be connected to Bai Han?

24:10.660 --> 24:12.120
Fate has already been set.

24:13.900 --> 24:14.960
This nursery rhyme

24:15.570 --> 24:17.570
is aimed at my tree heart.

24:18.750 --> 24:20.050
Even if that little magistrate

24:20.050 --> 24:22.250
had nothing to do with this previously,

24:22.850 --> 24:24.780
the moment he walks into this trap,

24:24.860 --> 24:25.860
there's no escaping it.
